Draft a reusable dashboard with view, from_view (own live card at the displayed version), or watch alone. The owner chooses Keep. Bind recurring refresh via schedule_routine.page_id this turn. Update replaces view/watch. On conflict, get first. Kept display is fixed. Changing alert disables alerts. Patch readings/items on kept pages. Ask before resuming paused/restored pages. Get includes readings/taps. Main lists all kept pages. Remove requires reason.

タイトル、理由、完了条件、メッセージなど、新たに生成するユーザー向けの引数は、ユーザーが別の言語を求める場合や元の表現が必要な項目を除き、日本語で書いてください。引用した原文、識別子、ツール名と引数名、列挙値、コマンドの接頭辞はそのまま保持してください。言語によって承認要件や権限の範囲が変わることはありません。

{"type":"object","required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","update","patch","get","list","remove"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":40,"description":"sidebar name, not built-in"},"icon":{"type":"string","description":"chart, list, calendar, heart…"},"why":{"type":"string","maxLength":200},"view":{"type":"object","description":"reply/open(https)/push.page/pop. No html/image."},"from_view":{"type":"object","required":["id","version"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"view_show ID"},"version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}},"watch":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"{question,display(number|status|table|trend),unit?,columns?,alert?:{when,value}}; null clears draft"},"reading":{"type":"object","description":"{value}|{status,text?}|{rows}"},"items":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"},"description":"<=50 components replacing existing key+type"},"alert_text":{"type":"string","maxLength":120},"version":{"type":"integer"},"note":{"type":"string","maxLength":120,"description":"history line"},"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":200}}}
